{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChJpZMxKWCbVz9iK5nez1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I changed the default `FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS` from `None` to `0o644`. However, `test_utils.tests` does not fully pass: 99 of 100 tests pass and one fails. That failure is expected with this fix, and I couldn't clear it without editing a test file, which the rules forbid.\n\n**Reproduction:** with default settings, `settings.FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS` printed `None`. With no mode set, `FileSystemStorage` never calls `chmod`. So a large upload, which is saved by moving a temp file, keeps the temp file's `0o600` mode, while a small upload saved from memory gets the normal umask mode (usually `0o644`).\n\n**Changes:**\n- `django/conf/global_settings.py`: the default is now `FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS = 0o644`, so every uploaded file gets the same mode.\n- `docs/ref/settings.txt`: the documented default is now `0o644`, and the OS-dependent behaviour is described as what happens when the setting is `None`.\n- `docs/releases/3.0.txt`: added a note under backwards-incompatible changes saying the default changed and that setting it to `None` restores the old behaviour.\n\n**The failing test:** `test_override_file_upload_permissions` asserts `assertIsNone(default_storage.file_permissions_mode)`, which only holds under the old `None` default. It now gets `0o644` (420). The test needs that one assertion updated to expect `0o644`; Django's own fix for this issue makes that same change.\n\nI also ran the `file_storage` tests. Their only error was `FileLikeObjectTestCase` failing to set up because the sandbox blocks opening a network socket (\"Operation not permitted\"), which has nothing to do with this change."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":23090,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":587},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9ac5ad50-997e-49af-809c-cf086eaada26","uuid":"51eb3f44-7bc9-4d43-bb23-0a147cdfe464","timestamp":"2026-11-22T23:18:18.062Z","request_id":"req_011ChJpZMntmT9Go8Pb8wvuQ"}
